OL,3,GNEWSANew school opens as part of wider
OL,4,A#20bn investment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA primary school in Derby has
OL,7,Fofficially reopened after a major
OL,8,Frebuild as part of a national programme
OL,9,Fto modernise sites across the country.
OL,11,FPupils returned to the new building at
OL,12,FBecket Primary School earlier this
OL,13,Fmonth, with the project forming part of
OL,14,Fa Department for Education (DfE) #20bn
OL,15,FSchool Rebuilding Programme.
OL,17,FDerby City Council successfully applied
OL,18,Ffor Becket Primary School and Pear Tree
OL,19,FInfant and Nursery School - which is
OL,20,Fset to be completed next month - to be
OL,21,Fincluded in the scheme.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
