OL,3,GNEWSANew school opens as part of wider
OL,4,A#20bn investment
OL,5,
OL,6,FBecket Primary School headteacher
OL,7,FAshley Guest said the new building
OL,8,Fmarked the start of an "exciting new
OL,9,Fchapter" for the school.
